0..80 Comment "/// `hello`\'s derivation, as `nix derivation show` prints it, read into a record"
81..102 Comment "/// type and a value."
103..106 Comment "///"
107..182 Comment "/// The Nix type provider reads a derivation into a record type the checker"
183..263 Comment "/// admits. No check-time site performs that read yet, so this source states the"
264..294 Comment "/// provider\'s answer by hand."
295..298 Comment "///"
299..378 Comment "/// `nix/hello.drv.json` is the read\'s JSON for this one derivation, each field"
379..454 Comment "/// of `Derivation` one of its keys. A map whose keys are no labels, as the"
455..533 Comment "/// outputs, the input derivations and the environment are, reads as a list of"
534..610 Comment "/// pairs, each key first. `inputs` reads as two fields, and the environment"
611..681 Comment "/// keeps its 17 variables holding a value, for a value prints at most"
682..702 Comment "/// 32 formers deep."
703..706 Comment "///"
707..723 Comment "/// - see: #2763"
724..740 Comment "/// - see: #2991"
741..757 Comment "/// - see: #2993"
758..774 Comment "/// - see: #3010"
775..827 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/package/nix/hello.drv.json`"
